      "created_at": "2018-06-13T20:48:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Heyo! In your opinion, what's the most iconic quote in the decks for each hero or villains.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I've got five that I can think of off of the top of my head:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Absolute Zero: \"Too cold? Welcome to my life.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Legacy: That one about him wondering what's for dinner.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tachyon: That time she talked really fast while hacking.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unity: \"Bee bot is more fun to say.\"</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Scholar: \"When life gives you lemons make a lemon cannon.\"</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:22.717Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
