      "raw": "<p>Heyo! In your opinion, what&#39;s the most iconic quote in the decks for each hero or villains.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I&#39;ve got five that I can think of off of the top of my head:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Absolute Zero: &quot;Too cold? Welcome to my life.&quot;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Legacy: That one about him wondering what&#39;s for dinner.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tachyon: That time she talked really fast while hacking.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unity: &quot;Bee bot is more fun to say.&quot;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Scholar: &quot;When life gives you lemons make a lemon cannon.&quot;</p>",
