      "created_at": "2018-06-13T21:19:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't read the flavor text much (frequently, to my regret), but:</p><p><span>Tempersonation:&nbsp;\"The polarizing power of electricity can produce many interesting results.\"</span></p><p><span>Real Tempest: I forget the exact quote, but it's the one from the Letters Page about his dog, something like: \"I don't know his name and he doesn't know mine, but he is my friend.\"</span></p><p>Iron Legacy: \"There is no longer a legacy to further. So be it.\"</p><p>Bunker: BUDDA<span>BUDDA</span><span>BUDDA</span><span>BUDDA</span><span>BUDDA</span><span>BUDDA</span></p>",
