      "raw": "[quote=\"MindWanderer\"]\n\nTempersonation: \"The polarizing power of electricity can produce many interesting results.\"\n\n[/quote]\n\nBeat me to it!\n\nI second \"Bee Bot,\" \"BUDDABUDDA,\" \"don't touch his hat,\" and the dog.\n\nI forget the exact flavor text, but I'd nominate the quotes from Utility Belt, Ta Moko, and Wrathful Gaze. Inspiring Presence has also got to be pretty close to the classic Superman \"truth, justice, and the American way!\" which, I assume, is why Guise parodies it.\n\nAlso, \"Hi Maya! Wanna fight crime?\"",
